# Website grounding rules

- Company doctrine lives in private `Axon-Enjin/company-docs`.
- This repo is **company-only** (`axonenjin.com`). It does **not** sell.
- For customer-facing copy and IA, read `docs/grounding/COMMERCIAL-MODEL-V2.md`, `WEBSITE-CONTRACT.md`, and `SITEMAP.md`.
- IA is two-property: company here; product at `axlefield.axonenjin.com` (other repo).
- Never invent prices, clients, press, investments, or extra projects.
- No peso/currency amounts on the public site (F-34).
- Ventures are secondary (Collaborate section). Never primary nav. Never an equal CTA to Collaborate.
- If grounding conflicts with live HTML, flag it — do not silently invent a third doctrine.
- Do not treat deleted `_retired-to-company-docs/` or product GTM files as source of truth on this host.
